INSERT INTO posts VALUES('BxNm0ntn9Vj','https://www.instagram.com/p/BxNm0ntn9Vj/','05/08/2019 3:03:55pm','carousel',552,11,'Tullahoma Regional Airport',6,unistr('Time to hang the rudder! All the control surfaces of a DC-3 are constructed of a metal frame work and then fabric-covered, a very labor-intensive process. We''re glad that''s behind us! They should be good for another 20 years now.\u000aOur volunteers are killing it!!\u000awww.mrdouglas.org  Follow Us.\u000a.\u000a.\u000a.\u000a.\u000a.\u000a@save_a_dc3 #stewartsystems #painting #aircraft #aircraftrestoration #stickandrudder #philanthropy#radialengine #photooftheday #pilot #pilotslife #photography #pilotlifestyle #aircraft #air #airplane #sky #skydiving #boeingcompany #boeinglovers #boeing #dc3restoration #dc3dc3plane #fly #flying #fun #avnerd #avgeek #aviationlovers #photooftheday #pilot #pilotlife #'),'077_05-08-2019');
INSERT INTO posts VALUES('BxYOEfQHsxu','https://www.instagram.com/p/BxYOEfQHsxu/','05/12/2019 5:59:17pm','image',512,6,'',1,unistr('Engine #2 is on the airplane, this is engine #1 for the left side. All we need now is a spare! Florida Air Cargo has another Pratt & Whitney 1830 - 75  with 500 hrs. total time. We can buy outright for $35,000 Dollars. I hope we can purchase it soon. If you would like to help, make a tax deductible donation on our website.\u000awww.mrdouglas.org\u000a.\u000a.\u000a.\u000a.\u000a@save_a_dc3  #aircraft #aircraftrestoration #stickandrudder #dc3plane #fly #flying #fun #avnerd #avgeek #aviationlovers #photooftheday #pilot #pilotlife #radialengine #prattwhitney #pilotslife #photography #pilotlifestyle #aircraft #air #airplane #sky #skydiving #boeingcompany #boeinglovers #boeing #dc3restoration #dc3'),'079_05-12-2019');
INSERT INTO posts VALUES('Bxh12cmJdEW','https://www.instagram.com/p/Bxh12cmJdEW/','05/16/2019 11:40:03am','carousel',681,20,'',3,unistr('Joe says it''s time to work on the instrument panel! We are getting rid of all the vacuum gauges and replacing them with electrical. Okay #garminaviation here is your chance!\u000amrdouglas.org\u000a.\u000a.\u000a.\u000a.\u000a@save_a_dc3 # #garminaviation #garminavionics #avionics #aircraft #aircraftrestoration #stickandrudder #dc3plane #fly #flying #fun #avnerd #avgeek #aviationlovers #photooftheday #pilot #pilotlife #philanthropy#radialengine #photooftheday #pilot #pilotslife #photography #pilotlifestyle #aircraft #air #airplane #sky #skydiving #boeingcompany #boeinglovers #boeing #dc3restoration #dc3'),'081_05-16-2019');
INSERT INTO posts VALUES('BxunnRNpi4g','https://www.instagram.com/p/BxunnRNpi4g/','05/21/2019 10:45:46am','carousel',355,2,'',3,unistr('Left engine pan needs some serious cleaning, any volunteers? We''ll have to use a Soda blaster, because sand will damage the surface of the stainless steel pan. Thank you dick Higley for taking on this tedious job. The pan looks great now.\u000awww.mrdouglas.org\u000a.\u000a.\u000a.\u000a.\u000a.\u000a@save_a_dc3  #aircraft #aircraftrestoration #stickandrudder #dc3plane #fly #flying #fun #avnerd #avgeek #aviationlovers #photooftheday #pilot #pilotlife #radialengine #prattwhitney #pilotslife #photography #pilotlifestyle #aircraft #air #airplane #sky #skydiving #boeingcompany #boeinglovers #boeing #dc3restoration #dc3'),'083_05-21-2019');
INSERT INTO posts VALUES('BxxKFnuJy6V','https://www.instagram.com/p/BxxKFnuJy6V/','05/22/2019 10:25:30am','image',433,10,'',1,unistr('Mr. Douglas has a visitor! Flagship Detroit what a gorgeous DC-3. Can''t wait to see Mr. D in this condition! \u000awww.mrdouglas.org\u000a.\u000a.\u000a.\u000a#flagship #flagshipdetroit #photooftheday #pilotlife #stickandrudder #dc3 #donalddouglas #mrdouglas #mcdonnelldouglas #fun\u000a#fly'),'085_05-22-2019');
INSERT INTO posts VALUES('ByG0oL9JLKc','https://www.instagram.com/p/ByG0oL9JLKc/','05/30/2019 8:21:16pm','carousel',300,4,'',3,unistr('DC-3 Oil cooler bracket cleaned, sandblasted, primered and painted. It''s like new again, so many pieces parts! It''s such a labor of love! \u000a#followus #donate \u000awww.mrdouglas.org\u000a.\u000a.\u000a.\u000a.\u000a.\u000a.\u000a#oil #oilcooler #aircraft #aircraftrestoration #piecesparts #stickandrudder #dc3plane #avnerd #avgeek #aviationlovers #photooftheday #boeing #dc3restoration #dc3'),'087_05-30-2019');
INSERT INTO posts VALUES('ByZQcOJpNKx','https://www.instagram.com/p/ByZQcOJpNKx/','06/07/2019 12:10:38am','image',411,2,'',1,unistr('This morning June 6th 2019, we watched the Reenactment Ceremony commemorating the 75 Anniversary of the D-Day Invasion. We watched in Awe as the formation of Dakotas crossed the English Channel to drop their jumpers in Normandy. We are very humbled and overwhelmed with pride as we installed the Left Elevator this afternoon on Mr. Douglas. It''s so important that we preserve our history for future generations to learn about, and enjoy. .\u000a.\u000a.\u000a#dakotas #reenactment #dday #ddayreenactment #fabricwork #dc3 \u000a#aircraftrestoration #tailwheel #pilots'),'089_06-07-2019');
INSERT INTO posts VALUES('BygCk6lBeY8','https://www.instagram.com/p/BygCk6lBeY8/','06/09/2019 3:28:34pm','video',513,9,'Tullahoma, Tennessee',1,unistr('Time to upgrade the instrument panel. Which wire goes to what? We removed about 10 lb of old avionic harnesses. I''m glad Joe knows what he''s doing!\u000awww.mrdouglas.org.\u000a.\u000a.\u000a.\u000a.\u000a#avionics #garminaviation #avionicstechnician #dc3 #dc3dakota #dc3plane #dc3restoration #restoration'),'091_06-09-2019');
